     SETTIME_TIMEOUT=SECONDS (resume: budget of the clock step; default 120 on 12 or more threads, 300 on 8 to 11, 600 below),
     SYNCCLOCK=1|auto and SYNCMAXAGE (resume: guest counter advance, opt-in),
