  echo "Optional, manual. The default lab golden has the sshd launchd job set to ProcessType Interactive:"
  echo "without it launchd throttles sshd and ssh-driven steps queue behind the login storm (desktop 109 s against 75 s, same binary)."
  echo "Boot once with 'snapintosh run', then:"
